1
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:24,840
Feng Bro, are you serious or just playing around?
鋒兄，你是認真的，還是在開玩笑？

2
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:29,980
Xiao Tu's laughing so hard, he's falling to the ground!
小塗笑得太厲害，快要跌到地上！

3
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:33,240
Feng Bro says he's getting married,
鋒兄說他要結婚，

4
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:36,440
And there's only one reason why.
理由就只有這一個。

5
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:39,400
On the day the lottery numbers came,
在彩券號碼開出的那一天，

6
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:42,140
Ya Girl's lucky picks hit the sky!
牙妹的幸運號碼中了頭獎！

7
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:44,780
Watching all that prize money fall,
看著獎金不斷落下，

8
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:47,960
His heart surrendered once and for all.
他的心也徹底被收服。

9
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:50,880
He said, "This must be destiny!"
他說：「這一定是命中注定！」

10
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:55,200
"How could I not marry her after all this mystery?"
「經歷這場奇蹟，怎能不娶她？」

11
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:59,740
The craziest wedding reason ever told,
史上最瘋狂的結婚理由，

12
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:02,380
Five Three Nine makes love unfold!
今彩五三九讓愛情開花！

13
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:05,760
One Ya Girl and one Yu Girl,
一個牙妹，一個魚妹，

14
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:08,300
Lucky numbers shake the world!
幸運號碼震撼全世界！

15
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:11,200
Two winning tickets, jackpot dreams,
兩張中獎券，頭獎夢成真，

16
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:13,820
Is love just luck or mathematics, it seems?
愛情究竟是運氣，還是數學題？

17
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:16,920
Laughing through tears, we all agree,
大家笑到流淚，都同意，

18
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:20,180
So crazy, so crazy, yet sweet as can be!
太瘋狂、太瘋狂，卻又甜蜜無比！

19
00:01:36,740 --> 00:01:39,600
Now it's Xiao Tu's turn to shine,
現在輪到小塗登場，

20
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:42,720
His story follows the very same line.
他的故事竟然如出一轍。

21
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:45,720
Watching Five Three Nine on the screen,
看著螢幕上的今彩五三九，

22
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:48,480
He jumped so high like he'd never been!
他跳得前所未有地高！

23
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:51,200
Yu Girl wrote some numbers down,
魚妹隨手寫了幾個號碼，

24
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:54,020
Several jackpot tickets came around!
竟然中了好幾張頭獎券！

25
00:01:54,020 --> 00:01:57,300
He said, "The God of Fortune called my name!"
他說：「財神爺都叫了我的名字！」

26
00:01:57,300 --> 00:02:02,440
"Not marrying her would be a shame!"
「不娶她，實在太不應該！」

27
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:06,060
Feng Bro holds Ya Girl's hand,
鋒兄牽著牙妹的手，

28
00:02:06,060 --> 00:02:08,860
Xiao Tu and Yu Girl make their stand.
小塗與魚妹並肩站好。

29
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:11,780
Ten tables, a hundred, wedding cheers,
十桌、百桌，婚宴歡呼，

30
00:02:11,780 --> 00:02:14,680
Everyone laughs until there are tears!
每個人都笑到流淚！

31
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:17,540
The craziest reason to say "I do,"
最瘋狂的結婚理由，

32
00:02:17,540 --> 00:02:20,500
Yet all those jackpot dreams came true!
竟讓所有頭獎夢都成真！

33
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:23,060
If happiness can be this wild and free,
如果幸福也能這樣自在瘋狂，

34
00:02:23,060 --> 00:02:29,060
Tomorrow I'll buy a ticket and see!
那我明天也買一張試試！
